[tool], is, in the catalog
    if [tool], returns, [anything]
[command], is, named as a command
    if [command], uses, [any tool], [any input]
    and [command], starts with, "command: "

[command], breaks, Every command uses a tool in the catalog
    if [command], uses, [tool], [any input]
    and not [tool], is, in the catalog
[command], breaks, Every command is named as a command
    if [command], uses, [any tool], [any input]
    and not [command], is, named as a command

a command with a tool nobody has, adds line, workflow.plain, "command: guess, uses, guess, x"
a command with a tool nobody has, must break, Every command uses a tool in the catalog

a command not named as a command, adds line, workflow.plain, "list it, uses, list, the folder"
a command not named as a command, must break, Every command is named as a command

[command], breaks, Every tool returns only what the catalog lists
    if [command], returned, [field], [any value]
    and [command], uses, [tool], [any input]
    and not [tool], returns, [field]

