    if [file], written in, [any language]

[file], breaks, The only knowledge is Datalog
    if [file], is, in the folder
    and not [file], is, known
[file], breaks, The only knowledge is Datalog
    if [file], has the comment, [any comment]

a file that is not datalog, adds line, notes.txt, a note
a file that is not datalog, must break, The only knowledge is Datalog

a comment, adds line, tools.go, // a note
a comment, must break, The only knowledge is Datalog

this run is a change
    if a change, is, the kind of this run
[change], is, a change
    if [change], adds line, [any file], [any line]
[change], is, missed
    if [change], must break, [law]
    and not [change], broke, [law]
[change], is, answered otherwise
    if [change], must answer, [answer]
    and not [change], answered, [answer]
[change], is, as stated
    if [change], is, a change
    and not [change], is, missed
    and not [change], is, answered otherwise
[law], is, a law
    if [any rule], lays down, [law]
[change], is, about an unknown law
    if [change], must break, [law]
    and not [law], is, a law
[law], is, proven
    if [any change], broke, [law]
[law], is, proven
    if this run is a change
    and [any change], must break, [law]

[law], breaks, Every law has a counterexample
    if [law], is, a law
    and not [law], is, proven
[change], breaks, Every change comes out as stated
    if [change], is, a change
    and not this run is a change
    and not [change], is, as stated
[change], breaks, Every change comes out as stated
    if [change], is, about an unknown law

a law with no counterexample, adds line, workflow.plain, "something, breaks, A law with no counterexample"
a law with no counterexample, must break, Every law has a counterexample

a change that expects an unknown law, adds line, workflow.plain, "a ghost change, must break, A law nobody laid down"
a change that expects an unknown law, must break, Every change comes out as stated

